	(text_box "Antenna\nActive L1/L2\n\nMulti-frequency high precision GNSS survey antenna compatible\nwith GPS, GLONASS, BEIDOU, and GALILEO systems.\n\nOutput impedance: 50Ω\nFrequency: 1150-1300MHz and 1520-1610MHz\n\nConnector: SMA(Female) Straight Edge Mount PCB Jack\nCable: RG58 with Male RP-SMA connector to M/F RP-SMA \n       adaptor to TNC Female Antenna connector."
